      "answer": "Your gold is already known from the server-loaded campaign state: **Eval Hero has 25 gold**.\n\nHere are all the Prosperity 1 items (001–016) and which ones you can afford on 25 gold:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Items you can afford (≤25g)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost | Effect |\n|---|------|------|------|--------|\n| 006 | Amulet of Life | Head | 15g | During your turn, perform *Heal 1*, Self [spent] |\n| 009 | Focusing Rod | One Hand | 10g | If you've performed a *Lost* action this turn, perform *Heal 1*, *Range 3* [spent] |\n| 013 | Element Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, Wild element [spent] |\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Items you cannot afford (>25g)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost |\n|---|------|------|------|\n| 015 | Comfortable Shoes | Legs | 20g — wait, this is ≤25g ✅ |\n| 016 | Circlet of Elements | Head | 20g — also ≤25g ✅ |\n\nLet me correct that table:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Items you can afford (≤25g)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost | Effect |\n|---|------|------|------|--------|\n| 006 | Amulet of Life | Head | 15g | *Heal 1*, Self [spent] |\n| 009 | Focusing Rod | One Hand | 10g | After a *Lost* action: *Heal 1*, *Range 3* [spent] |\n| 013 | Element Potion | Small Item | 10g | Wild element [spent] |\n| 015 | Comfortable Shoes | Legs | 20g | Basic bottom action becomes *Move 3* instead of *Move 2* |\n| 016 | Circlet of Elements | Head | 20g | During your turn, generate Wild element [spent] |\n\n---\n\nThe search returned data on items 006, 009, 013, 015, and 016 from the Prosperity 1 range. Items 001–005, 007–008, 010–012, and 014 were **not returned** in the tool results, so I cannot confirm their costs or effects from verified data this session. I'd recommend checking those cards directly in your copy of the game.\n\n*Source: Gloomhaven (2nd Edition) Rulebook p. 52 (prosperity/item table); Card Index items 006, 009, 013, 015, 016.*",
